# Inbox PII protection - defense in depth layer 1 (.gitignore)
# Layer 2: README.md per subfolder (cognitive barrier)
# Layer 3: pre-commit hook (only layer that blocks git add -f)

# Zonas reguladas: ignorar todo el contenido excepto placeholders
inbox/Contratos/*
!inbox/Contratos/.gitkeep
!inbox/Contratos/README.md

inbox/Firmas/*
!inbox/Firmas/.gitkeep
!inbox/Firmas/README.md

inbox/Muestras/*
!inbox/Muestras/.gitkeep
!inbox/Muestras/README.md
